cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "SURF ETDS yearly QA"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below, and cite the data with the citation of surf-etds-data."
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Tim
    family-names: Buck
    affiliation: "Medical University of Innsbruck"
  # Further contributors are listed in CONTRIBUTORS.md.
repository-code: "https://github.com/AG-Kollotzek/surf-etds-qa"
abstract: >-
  Yearly quality assurance of the tracking accuracy of ExacTrac Dynamic Surface
  across the linear accelerators of a radiotherapy department, measured with the
  SURF Test Unit motion phantom: evaluation of the phantom and tracking logs,
  pass-rate classification, calibration of the phantom kinematics against X-ray
  sphere detection, and generation of per-linac QA reports.
keywords:
  - radiotherapy
  - surface-guided radiotherapy
  - SGRT
  - quality assurance
  - medical physics
# The code is MIT; the documentation, the result tables and the report templates are CC-BY-4.0.
license: MIT
license-url: "https://github.com/AG-Kollotzek/surf-etds-qa/blob/main/README.md#licence"
version: "1.0.0"
references:
  - type: data
    title: "SURF-ETDS measurement data"
    authors:
      - given-names: Tim
        family-names: Buck
    repository-code: "https://github.com/AG-Kollotzek/surf-etds-data"
    notes: >-
      The raw data evaluated here (campaigns 2026-07-15_L1, 2026-07-29_L0,
      2026-08-06_L3 and 2026-08-06_L4), included as a git submodule.
  - type: software
    title: "SURF Test Unit: a low-cost 3-DOF motion phantom for surface-guidance QA"
    authors:
      - given-names: Tim
        family-names: Buck
    repository-code: "https://github.com/AG-Kollotzek/surf-etds-phantom"
  - type: software
    title: "SURF ETD analysis pipeline"
    authors:
      - given-names: Tim
        family-names: Buck
    repository-code: "https://github.com/AG-Kollotzek/surf-etds-analysis"
